"Global monthly mean, {0} {1}": "Wereldwijd maandgemiddelde, {0} {1}",
"Increase over the last {0} months (trend, {1} {2}–{3} {4})": "Toename over de laatste {0} maanden (trend, {1} {2}–{3} {4})",
