"All greenhouse gases: nitrous oxide, CFCs, HFCs and SF₆": "Alle broeikasgassen: distikstofoxide (lachgas), cfk's, hfk's en SF₆",
"The warming effect of every long-lived greenhouse gas, nitrous oxide, and the ozone-layer gases and their replacements. NOAA Global Monitoring Laboratory data.": "Het opwarmende effect van elk langlevend broeikasgas, distikstofoxide, en de ozonlaaggassen en hun vervangers. Gegevens van het NOAA Global Monitoring Laboratory.",
"<b>Source:</b> NOAA Global Monitoring Laboratory: Annual Greenhouse Gas Index (warming effect of each gas) and the yearly global means behind it; globally averaged monthly nitrous oxide. HFC-{0} after {1}: AGAGE (Prinn et al. {2}, <a>doi:10.5194/essd-{3}-{4}-{5}</a>). NOAA's values are shown unchanged; the shares, changes since {6} and peaks are calculated by this page.": "<b>Bron:</b> NOAA Global Monitoring Laboratory: Annual Greenhouse Gas Index (opwarmend effect van elk gas) en de jaarlijkse wereldgemiddelden daarachter; wereldgemiddelde maandwaarden van distikstofoxide. HFC-{0:raw} na {1}: AGAGE (Prinn e.a. {2}, <a>doi:10.5194/essd-{3:raw}-{4:raw}-{5:raw}</a>). De waarden van NOAA worden ongewijzigd getoond; de aandelen, veranderingen sinds {6} en pieken worden door deze pagina berekend.",
