"<a>\"Antarctic sea ice is growing\"</a>": "<a>'Het Antarctische zee-ijs groeit'</a>",
"Thousand km³": "Duizend km³",
"{0}M km²": "{0} mln. km²",
"snow cover, week of {0} {1}": "sneeuwbedekking, week van {0} {1}",
"compared with the {0}–{1} average for that week": "vergeleken met het gemiddelde van {0}–{1} voor die week",
